{%- comment -%}
Breadcrumbs Snippet
Params:
  class_nav: Classes for the nav element
  class_list: Classes for the ol element
  class_item: Classes for li elements
  class_link: Classes for a elements
  class_current: Classes for the last (current) item
  separator: Text drawn between crumbs (default none; most themes use CSS)
  home_label: Overrides the first crumb's label (e.g. a translated "Home")
  page_label: Word before the number on a paginated page's last crumb (default "Page")
  aria_label: Accessible name for the nav element (default "Breadcrumb")
  show_home: Set to false to drop the first crumb
Globals (via LiquidJS globals):
  breadcrumbs: Trail for the page being rendered, Home first and the current
    page last; empty on the homepage's first page, where this snippet renders nothing.
    Each entry: label, href, canonicalPath, current, home, and pageNumber on a
    paginated page's numbered crumb.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- if breadcrumbs.size > 0 -%}
  <nav class="{{ class_nav }}" aria-label="{{ aria_label | default: 'Breadcrumb' }}">
    <ol class="{{ class_list }}">
      {%- for crumb in breadcrumbs -%}
        {%- unless crumb.home and show_home == false -%}
          {%- assign label = crumb.label -%}
          {%- if crumb.home and home_label != blank -%}
            {%- assign label = home_label -%}
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- if crumb.pageNumber -%}
            {%- assign label = page_label | default: 'Page' | append: ' ' | append: crumb.label -%}
          {%- endif -%}
          <li class="{{ class_item }}{% if crumb.current and class_current != blank %} {{ class_current }}{% endif %}">
            {%- if crumb.current -%}
              <span aria-current="page">{{ label }}</span>
            {%- elsif crumb.href -%}
              <a href="{{ crumb.href }}" class="{{ class_link }}">{{ label }}</a>
            {%- else -%}
              <span>{{ label }}</span>
            {%- endif -%}
            {%- if separator != blank and forloop.last == false -%}
              <span aria-hidden="true">{{ separator }}</span>
            {%- endif -%}
          </li>
        {%- endunless -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
    </ol>
  </nav>
{%- endif -%}
